    <div class="field__label">Preview text</div>
              <div class="field__item"><ul>  <li>Fills bottles from 1 to 19 L with purified water on demand</li>  <li>9-stage filtration – removes 99.8% of impurities, improves taste and balance</li>  <li>Fast dispensing – up to 6 L/min, minimal waiting time</li>  <li>Remote monitoring – real-time control, alerts, and emergency protection</li>  <li>UV protection keeps water safe and fresh – prevents backflow and contamination</li>  <li>Multiple payment options – coin, bill, and QR supported</li></ul></div>
