      <h2 class="pd-h2" id="list-item-1">
        Product information
      </h2>
            
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The Ecosoft AQUABOX 150 A reverse osmosis water vending machine is a smart and eco-friendly solution for safe, great-tasting drinking water. Designed for installation in grocery stores and connected to the municipal water supply, AQUABOX delivers purified water through a reliable 9-stage filtration system with mineralization and pH adjustment. It provides an affordable and sustainable alternative to bottled water, reducing plastic waste while attracting repeat customers with convenience and quality.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With a dispensing speed of up to 6 L/min and support for multiple payment options, AQUABOX 150 A ensures minimal waiting time and maximum accessibility. The system also features remote monitoring and built-in UV protection, guaranteeing safe operation and consistent water quality every day.</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>
      
    </div>
  
  
            
